      "desc:8": "The Dense State Manipulator is the bridge to the critical era: a 21x30x11 tier-2 rhodium-plated palladium build that compresses plain steam into dense steam at 1000:1 — and decompresses back at 1:1000 with a screwdriver click.\n\nIt eats whichever grade sits in its hatches — steam, superheated or supercritical — and emits the matching dense variant. Fuel comes from the input bus: a plain singularity lasts 200 seconds but takes a 20% output haircut; a critical one lasts the same 200 seconds with zero loss.\n\nFeed it criticals once the CSC is online. At million-liter scale that 20% eats fast.",
